    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple state for a set. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This represents a state containing a set of values. The interface supports modelling sets that contain all possible elements. The state&apos;s internal value is modified using union or intersection operations. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
